# Defect 453, lane b18-ffi, 2026-10-10 (panel 202's R3; the ffi-pragmatist's
# `macro3`): `build` prints 300 and 8; in the one file `--emit-c` writes, the
# first module's macro rewrites the second's `twice`, which clang compiles
# into another program. Until 2026-10-10 it was written at exit 0.
use narrow
use hundred

function main()
    print(hundred.hundredfold(x: 3))
    print(narrow.doubled(x: 4))
